From 72cb728a2d7ee2e13b194db88cac5155dde1bae8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: No <No@ty.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 20:45:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(tts): premium/enhanced voice badges and
 quality-first ordering
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Voices from the OpenAI-compatible server now carry their quality tier on
TTSVoice (optional field; other clients unaffected). In the Read Aloud
voice picker, premium voices sort first (then enhanced, then the rest,
with locale preference breaking ties) and each above-default voice shows
a color-coded badge — primary-colored PREMIUM, muted ENHANCED — instead
of baking the tier into the name.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
